        "TileImage": "$($repository 53feef3a-f1fa-405a-8cad-d6c6dbae1ff9).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. Today you will return to Chongqing, to the same lab. Today our client is the patient himself. He is a millionaire who wanted to completely change his appearance. However, he has seen other patients treated very badly, so he no longer wants to have the operation. However, he has also noticed that the more he wants to leave, the more he is being pulled away. The targets are his personal surgeon, Shirong Dai, and two guards, who are the only people standing between him and escape.",
